175:   /**
176:    * Creates a handler that can be used as the entry point for a Guice backed Ratpack app.
177:    * <p>
178:    * Modules are processed eagerly. Before this method returns, the modules will be used to create a single {@link com.google.inject.Injector} instance.
179:    * This injector is available to the given handler via service lookup.
